1
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:44,300
"My Secret Vampire"

2
00:00:44,530 --> 00:00:48,350
(Episode 3)

3
00:00:48,410 --> 00:00:49,410
High fat.

4
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:52,060
The perfect combination of high carbs.

5
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,569
Vitamin-rich fruits.

6
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:56,850
Drizzled with plenty of sweet honey.

7
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:59,060
Just the right amount.

8
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:01,206
I hope this makes you
gain at least five kilos.

9
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:02,230
Han Dongha.

10
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,700
What's this?

11
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:11,850
What's with all the commotion?

12
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:13,200
Yes, Chef.

13
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,060
Honestly, these guys.

14
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:19,860
What is this?

15
00:01:20,410 --> 00:01:22,370
It must be tough working
so early in the morning.

16
00:01:23,970 --> 00:01:25,070
Hey, wait a minute.

17
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:28,200
(+15 calories)

18
00:01:28,270 --> 00:01:29,470
Our Dongha...

19
00:01:29,490 --> 00:01:31,510
You always go to work
without eating breakfast.

20
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:34,080
Eat this to get your energy up.

21
00:01:34,390 --> 00:01:35,950
Don't feel pressured.

22
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,040
Then I'll dig in.

23
00:01:40,690 --> 00:01:41,890
Be careful on your way.

24
00:01:44,490 --> 00:01:46,226
The way you dote on him,
you'd think he was your own son.

25
00:01:46,250 --> 00:01:48,730
I may not have given birth to
him, but I basically raised him.

26
00:01:48,850 --> 00:01:50,590
With lots and lots of love.

27
00:01:51,250 --> 00:01:53,570
Seriously, giving me goosebumps
this early in the morning.

28
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,300
Dongha!

29
00:02:02,990 --> 00:02:04,020
Quick, cover his eyes.

30
00:02:04,390 --> 00:02:05,980
Whoa, that was a close call.

31
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:08,290
Ah, let's go, let's go.

32
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,500
Come on.

33
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:17,240
- Careful.
- We're sitting down now.

34
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,240
Don't open your eyes yet.

35
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:23,020
Here we go.

36
00:02:23,490 --> 00:02:23,910
What's this?

37
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:24,880
Is today a special occasion?

38
00:02:24,890 --> 00:02:26,530
It's a huge day.

39
00:02:26,610 --> 00:02:28,220
A welcome ceremony for Han Dongha.

40
00:02:28,310 --> 00:02:29,780
A round of applause.

41
00:02:29,850 --> 00:02:30,850
Come on.

42
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,840
This...

43
00:02:33,050 --> 00:02:34,050
You have to eat it all.

44
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:39,920
We'll be full just watching you eat.

45
00:02:40,110 --> 00:02:41,209
Go on, eat.

46
00:02:41,210 --> 00:02:42,350
I'll enjoy it.

47
00:02:44,300 --> 00:02:45,500
(-230 calories)

48
00:02:52,350 --> 00:02:53,880
Wow, this is delicious.

49
00:02:54,810 --> 00:02:56,670
Do you want to eat this one too?

50
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,260
Really?

51
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,200
(-220 calories)

52
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,760
Why aren't you eating?

53
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:09,480
It's delicious.

54
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,840
Hurry up and eat.

55
00:03:12,380 --> 00:03:13,380
Hyung.

56
00:03:13,460 --> 00:03:14,700
You eat this kind of stuff too?

57
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,160
Of course.

58
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,920
There's so much delicious food out there.

59
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:20,380
What's wrong?

60
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:21,990
Don't tell me you're not going to eat.

61
00:03:22,930 --> 00:03:24,130
I'm not really interested.

62
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:26,960
Look how skinny our Gyumin is.

63
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:31,850
You should put on some weight.

64
00:03:32,030 --> 00:03:32,450
That's not it.

65
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:33,860
I'm perfectly normal right now.

66
00:03:35,950 --> 00:03:36,950
Eat this.

67
00:03:41,330 --> 00:03:43,130
Chew it slowly and carefully.

68
00:03:47,090 --> 00:03:48,290
Oh, hold on, hold on.

69
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,520
My phone is...

70
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:50,750
Who is it?

71
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,530
Hello?

72
00:03:51,610 --> 00:03:52,610
It's good.

73
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,480
Come here.

74
00:04:18,060 --> 00:04:19,610
Gyumin, are you okay?

75
00:04:20,140 --> 00:04:21,140
Gyumin.

76
00:04:29,170 --> 00:04:30,170
You traitor.

77
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:31,980
How could you run away by yourself?

78
00:04:33,310 --> 00:04:35,150
Then why didn't you run away too?

79
00:04:35,910 --> 00:04:37,450
I'm scared of Juwon.

80
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:39,099
Don't you know I was
disrespectful to him before...

81
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:40,580
and ended up bedridden for a week?

82
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:42,850
For such a big guy, you're a real coward.

83
00:04:47,550 --> 00:04:48,580
Are you alright?

84
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:52,260
Sigh, I'm scared of Juwon now too.

85
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:54,170
You guys saw it too, right?

86
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:55,670
Huh? Did you see it?

87
00:04:55,930 --> 00:04:57,196
He was eating human
food like it was a feast.

88
00:04:57,220 --> 00:04:58,760
And he didn't even bat an eye.

89
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,289
We just wanted a little
taste of Dongha's blood.

90
00:05:01,290 --> 00:05:02,500
Is that such a crime?

91
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:05,630
Is Juwon feeling better now?

92
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:09,450
There's no way he's okay.

93
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,320
Want some dessert?

94
00:05:16,100 --> 00:05:17,100
No thanks.

95
00:05:19,250 --> 00:05:20,450
By the way.

96
00:05:21,490 --> 00:05:22,930
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

97
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:24,020
What?

98
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:27,190
You didn't eat what I gave you.

99
00:05:27,250 --> 00:05:28,000
But what the others gave you...

100
00:05:28,001 --> 00:05:29,050
you ate it all up.

101
00:05:30,620 --> 00:05:31,920
Think whatever you want.

102
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:39,660
What's your problem?

103
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:42,010
You look terrible.

104
00:06:00,030 --> 00:06:01,030
Jeez.

105
00:06:01,380 --> 00:06:02,810
It'll get better right away.

106
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,520
Ah.

107
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:40,280
I'm fine.

108
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,169
You're making a big deal out of nothing.

109
00:06:43,170 --> 00:06:45,450
I'm not overreacting, you
just pricked me out of nowhere.

110
00:06:45,780 --> 00:06:47,910
Who makes such a fuss
over something like this?

111
00:06:48,110 --> 00:06:49,210
You're not a child.

112
00:06:49,230 --> 00:06:51,800
What child? Give me your
hand, let's see how you like it.

113
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,169
Hey, why should I?

114
00:06:53,170 --> 00:06:54,226
I'm not the one who's sick.

115
00:06:54,250 --> 00:06:55,690
Then stick out your foot and try it.

116
00:06:56,730 --> 00:06:58,590
Hey, not my foot, my hand.

117
00:07:05,310 --> 00:07:06,690
It's much better now.

118
00:07:07,420 --> 00:07:08,620
Thank you.

119
00:07:11,030 --> 00:07:12,230
But...

120
00:07:12,900 --> 00:07:14,890
Why are you so protective of Dongha?

121
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,270
Me, protective of him?

122
00:07:18,050 --> 00:07:19,290
That's how it looks to me.

123
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:21,060
What are you talking about?

124
00:07:21,610 --> 00:07:23,660
I'm just trying to avoid trouble.

125
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:25,710
Is that so?

126
00:07:26,050 --> 00:07:27,050
Yeah.

127
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:30,240
Honestly, I've wanted
to kick him out for a while.

128
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:32,150
But I can't do that.

129
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:36,620
My goal is to get him
to leave safely first.

130
00:07:37,410 --> 00:07:38,610
So you should help me out too.

131
00:07:41,910 --> 00:07:43,350
Why are you looking at me like that?

132
00:07:46,590 --> 00:07:47,590
It's nothing.

133
00:07:48,910 --> 00:07:50,110
And, don't worry.

134
00:07:50,730 --> 00:07:51,930
Didn't I tell you?

135
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,490
I'm quite fond of Han Dongha.

136
00:07:55,090 --> 00:07:56,810
What is it about him that you like so much?

137
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,600
He's kind.

138
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,040
He's cute.

139
00:08:01,060 --> 00:08:02,260
And also...

140
00:08:05,820 --> 00:08:07,990
Aren't you curious how
delicious his blood will be?

141
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:13,900
I'm not curious at all.

142
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,800
You...

143
00:08:16,801 --> 00:08:18,260
Don't you dare do anything reckless.

144
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,000
I can't promise that.

145
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,080
Didn't I tell you?

146
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,020
I'm quite fond of Han Dongha.

147
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:45,840
He's kind.

148
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:47,860
He's cute.

149
00:08:50,620 --> 00:08:51,620
No.

150
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:53,196
How is it possible he
didn't even gain 100 grams?

151
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:54,220
Is this for real?

152
00:08:57,090 --> 00:08:58,290
Is it broken?

153
00:08:58,970 --> 00:08:59,970
Dongha.

154
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,776
Are you training to be a
kpop idol or something?

155
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:03,980
No, it's nothing like that.

156
00:09:05,070 --> 00:09:06,630
But why are you asking about my weight?

157
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:08,620
Oh, oh, oh... Uh, well...

158
00:09:08,650 --> 00:09:09,820
Ah, look at that hill.

159
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,270
Oh, it's because we're worried about you.

160
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,280
Because we're worried.

161
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:14,470
I'm healthier than I look.

162
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,580
I'm off to my part-time job.

163
00:09:23,490 --> 00:09:26,580
What kind of job does he do
that he never gains any weight?

164
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,680
Should we follow him and see?

165
00:09:31,590 --> 00:09:32,790
I'll go check.

166
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:36,800
Huh?

167
00:09:38,130 --> 00:09:39,330
Where are the car keys?

168
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,560
And...

169
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:55,970
Aren't you curious how
delicious his blood will be?

170
00:09:58,690 --> 00:09:59,990
Absolutely not.

171
00:10:01,390 --> 00:10:02,870
Why should I trust Kang Seonjae?

172
00:10:04,850 --> 00:10:06,950
Wait, I've got nothing to
do. What am I doing here?

173
00:10:07,890 --> 00:10:09,420
I might as well just sleep.

174
00:10:14,410 --> 00:10:15,820
Can you handle this by yourself?

175
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,390
Yes, I'll be fine.

176
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,496
I can actually do it myself.

177
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,520
You should go inside.

178
00:10:19,750 --> 00:10:20,750
Thank you.

179
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:22,020
Thanks for your hard work.

180
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:32,260
We're vampires.

181
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:35,500
Is it right to learn by
watching vampire movies?

182
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,040
Hey.

183
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:39,500
Among all the famous directors,
isn't there a single vampire?

184
00:11:40,070 --> 00:11:41,850
This is a classic. Just watch it.

185
00:11:46,570 --> 00:11:47,770
Here it comes.

186
00:11:50,530 --> 00:11:51,730
What are you doing?!

187
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:03,980
What are you doing?

188
00:12:04,090 --> 00:12:05,530
Don't you know what a simulation is?

189
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:08,030
He needs to succeed
on the first try, doesn't he?

190
00:12:10,030 --> 00:12:11,630
Whatever, just watch the movie.

191
00:12:12,490 --> 00:12:13,690
Hey, but...

192
00:12:15,350 --> 00:12:18,230
Why is that vampire
chasing only that one human?

193
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:21,060
He's probably addicted
to that human's blood.

194
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:29,820
Could it be...

195
00:12:30,270 --> 00:12:32,060
I'm not going to end up like that, am I?

196
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:36,089
What if I get addicted to Dongha's blood...

197
00:12:36,090 --> 00:12:36,650
and for the rest of my life...

198
00:12:36,651 --> 00:12:38,590
I'll just be following him around?

199
00:12:42,070 --> 00:12:43,070
What?

200
00:12:47,340 --> 00:12:48,540
Just watch the movie.

201
00:12:55,810 --> 00:12:56,950
Can I help you?

202
00:12:59,890 --> 00:13:01,210
Okay, thank you.

203
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:13,370
What am I even doing here?

204
00:13:15,710 --> 00:13:17,010
Are you ready to order?

205
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:18,800
No, thank you.

206
00:13:19,140 --> 00:13:20,260
I'll come back another time.

207
00:13:20,630 --> 00:13:21,630
Okay.

208
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:30,080
You... You're so going to get it today.

209
00:13:30,940 --> 00:13:32,680
- I'm sorry.
- Damn it.

210
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:35,750
I...

211
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:38,580
My day is ruined. Who's going
to take responsibility for this?

212
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:42,120
You're putting me in
a very difficult position.

213
00:13:43,050 --> 00:13:44,050
Damn it.

214
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:46,880
I'm gonna... Ah!

215
00:13:58,810 --> 00:13:59,810
Hyung.

216
00:14:00,230 --> 00:14:01,230
Let's go outside.

217
00:14:05,060 --> 00:14:06,410
I'm at work right now.

218
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:12,899
Look, even so...

219
00:14:12,900 --> 00:14:14,566
you shouldn't have
just come here like this.

220
00:14:14,590 --> 00:14:16,350
I was just so frustrated,
is that a problem?

221
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,860
I just started this job.

222
00:14:19,930 --> 00:14:21,130
I'm about to get fired.

223
00:14:21,210 --> 00:14:22,560
I'll take responsibility.

224
00:14:23,010 --> 00:14:24,010
Just be quiet.

225
00:14:24,570 --> 00:14:25,570
Me?

226
00:14:27,690 --> 00:14:29,180
How are you going to do that?

227
00:15:06,390 --> 00:15:09,530
"My Secret Vampire"

